  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: 0ca23d3e41cd5424c9ec72c610ef25a4, type: 3}
  m_Name: MonikaGetsMarchingOrders
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: 
  autoFocusSpeaker: 1
  screens:
  - speaker: {fileID: 0}
    dialog: 
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 1790118740072857612
    - rid: 1790118740072857613
    - rid: 1790118740072857614
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 5301facf4ef9bfe46bdb4745494365d2, type: 2}
    dialog: Monika? Where have you been-?!?
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 1790118740072857615
    - rid: 1790118740072857617
    - rid: 1790118740072857618
    - rid: 1790118740072857619
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 5301facf4ef9bfe46bdb4745494365d2, type: 2}
    dialog: You didn't report back in after your patrol at the end of the day- what
      happened?
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 1790118740072857620
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: bcc4aa0537be91d488c1075e0cd8d29a, type: 2}
    dialog: '(I need to report my patrols to him at the end of the day...) '
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 1790118740072857621
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: bcc4aa0537be91d488c1075e0cd8d29a, type: 2}
    dialog: (Sure, that makes sense.)
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 1790118740072857622
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: bcc4aa0537be91d488c1075e0cd8d29a, type: 2}
    dialog: I'm sorry, Jarl Balgruuf, I got myself caught up in some, uh...
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 1790118740072857623
  - speaker: {fileID: 0}
    dialog: 
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 1790118740072857626
  - speaker: {fileID: 0}
    dialog: 
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 1790118740072857627
  - speaker: {fileID: 0}
    dialog: 
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 1790118740072857630
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 5301facf4ef9bfe46bdb4745494365d2, type: 2}
    dialog: Well, now that you're finally here, I've got something that needs your
      attention-
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 1790118740072857636
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 5301facf4ef9bfe46bdb4745494365d2, type: 2}
    dialog: Irileth, please fill her in.
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: e66ba0c6207b7664dbb0b977115f10b2, type: 2}
    dialog: Very well.
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 1790118740072857638
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: e66ba0c6207b7664dbb0b977115f10b2, type: 2}
    dialog: Anoriath, one of the owners of the Drunken Hunstman was found dead this
      morning by his brother, Elrindir.
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 1790118740072857637
    - rid: 1790118740072857639
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: e66ba0c6207b7664dbb0b977115f10b2, type: 2}
    dialog: The assailant still remains unknown; no one seems to have witnessed the
      crime.
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: e66ba0c6207b7664dbb0b977115f10b2, type: 2}
    dialog: One of the guards is already down there investigating where the deed
      was done, you should join him.
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: bcc4aa0537be91d488c1075e0cd8d29a, type: 2}
    dialog: Of course, I'll get right to it.
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 1790118740072857640
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: bcc4aa0537be91d488c1075e0cd8d29a, type: 2}
    dialog: I won't rest until the murderer is brought to justice!
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 1790118740072857641
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 5301facf4ef9bfe46bdb4745494365d2, type: 2}
    dialog: Very good. Now get to it.
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 1790118740072857642
  - speaker: {fileID: 0}
    dialog: 
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 1790118740072857643
    - rid: 1790118740072857644
    - rid: 1790118740072857645
    - rid: 1790118740072857646
    - rid: 1790118740072857648
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: bcc4aa0537be91d488c1075e0cd8d29a, type: 2}
    dialog: (A proper investigation of a crime? I really am a police officer!)
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 1790118740072857649
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: bcc4aa0537be91d488c1075e0cd8d29a, type: 2}
    dialog: (... I wonder if the forensics are going to be any good...)
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 1790118740072857650
  - speaker: {fileID: 0}
    dialog: 
    ScreenActions: []
